      "message": "Nit: `Config.plugins[\"email\"][\"report_cc\"].split(\",\")` raises KeyError if the email section lacks report_cc and AttributeError if it\u0027s null. Pre-existing at every old call site, but this is now the single choke point, so `(Config.plugins[\"email\"].get(\"report_cc\") or \"\").split(\",\")` is cheap hardening. Also `cc` passed as a plain string would iterate characters (all in-repo callers pass lists — assignment.ccuser is a MutableList and schedules.py normalizes inbound strings — so just noting the type contract).",
